## Scene Setup

Same location — semi-private camp beneath Solitude's arch, near the standing stones.

But the staging is different.

Alonythil is already there. But he's not leisurely reviewing her file. He has MULTIPLE documents. A small operational workspace — maps, encoded dispatches, notes from other debriefs. He's mid-work when they arrive. He's busy. This isn't a dedicated hearing for Alenawe — this is a stop on a circuit. She's on the schedule between two other things.

He wraps up what he was doing. Not hurried — efficient. Files something. Looks up.

He does not stand.

He is not hostile. He is not warm. He is *managing*.

